3	// routing_smart.go ranks configured providers for a requested model or model
4	// reference when the standalone `fiz` CLI needs a local provider selection.
5	//
6	// As of agent-1a486c2e, the canonical cross-harness routing engine lives in
7	// `internal/routing` and is reachable via `fizeau.FizeauService.ResolveRoute`. The
8	// engine ranks `(harness, provider, model)` tuples uniformly and replaces
9	// what used to be a parallel implementation here.
10	//
11	// New consumers should call `internal/routing.Resolve` through
12	// `service.ResolveRoute` rather than `buildSmartRoutePlan` directly.
